.TH GJALLARHORN\-SENDER 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
gjallarhorn\-sender \- Emit UPC trigger packets (Gjallarhorn) for Mímir's Law.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gjallarhorn\-sender
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Emit UPC trigger packets (Gjallarhorn) for Mímir's Law.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-cluster \fIN\fR
cluster ID (default 1)
.TP
.B \-\-iface \fISTRING\fR
network interface for multicast
.TP
.B \-\-kind \fISTRING\fR
bootstrap | reverify (default bootstrap)
.TP
.B \-\-manifest \fISTRING\fR
Mjölnir manifest pointer (hex) (default 0xCAFEBABE)
.TP
.B \-\-multicast
multicast to local segment (bootstrap)
.TP
.B \-\-target \fISTRING\fR
unicast target host (reverify)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
gjallarhorn\-sender \-\-kind bootstrap \-\-cluster 1 \-\-manifest 0xCAFE \-\-multicast
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
